e.\n\nThe truth is non-partisan.\n\nCapitol switchboard at (202) 224-3121.\n\n#MeToo #TimesUp","userId":4214321,"media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":66,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":103,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":21.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1042222602503290880","date":1537320206000,"rawContent":"Every survivor knows this. Every survivor feels this. I had a deadbolt on my bedroom door as a kid and could only sleep when the TV was on because that meant he was awake and I was safe. I was 10. \n\nIt took me 30 years to finally learn how to fall asleep without the TV on. #MeToo","userId":4214321,"media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":22.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":66,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":104,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":22.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1042359259818803200","date":1537352788000,"rawContent":"@Patti1120 @WarfareNavel @mj_lee I am so sorry for your pain. Thank you for speaking up. The more of us who do, the less alone we all are, the stronger we are together. #MeToo","userId":4214321,"media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":23.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":66,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":105,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":23.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1042371834606481408","date":1537355786000,"rawContent":"The emotional scars of sexual assault never heal. There are moments the memories come back, decades later, and I am doubled over, tears flowing. I will never be untouched. \n\nI stand with Dr. Blasey Ford. #MeToo","userId":4214321,"media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":66,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":106,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1042762797787041792","date":1537448999000,"rawContent":"This is my truth too. Please watch, share, and hold the survivors in your life extra close. #DearProfessorFord #MeToo","userId":4214321,"media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":66,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":107,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1042792993412005888","date":1537456198000,"rawContent":"Fire. #MeToo #SupremeCourt","userId":4214321,"media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":26.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":66,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":108,"sumOfClimate":19,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":26.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1042928983959134209","date":1537488621000,"rawContent":"You called on the @FBI during the Clarence Thomas confirmation. You are a hypocrite. You are a judicial thug. \n\nShame on you, @ChuckGrassley, and anyone who supports you.\n\n#AnitaHill #DearProfessorFord #MeToo\u2060 \u2060","userId":4214321,"media":null,"username":"Mattison","containsBlackLivesMatter":false